    {
      "id": 395007,
      "username": "Jon_AK",
      "name": "Jon",
      "created_at": "2024-02-22T22:42:56.918Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"nudna\" data-post=\"2\" data-topic=\"117709\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/n/34f0e0/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> nudna:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>If all you are trying to do is customise what is shown in the main body of the screen then from what I can see you set that by using the edit button then in edit mode go to settings.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>That is all I’m trying to do but the settings never take.  I too have just begun using ERPNext &amp; testing out its capabiities.  This is what I have tried:<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/4/2/42b69ec88c87bb9056712d83372297aa4ec07efd.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/42b69ec88c87bb9056712d83372297aa4ec07efd\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/2/42b69ec88c87bb9056712d83372297aa4ec07efd_2_690x296.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"9waM3A9XP1vk9RUhz06fmIppMwR\" width=\"690\" height=\"296\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/2/42b69ec88c87bb9056712d83372297aa4ec07efd_2_690x296.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/2/42b69ec88c87bb9056712d83372297aa4ec07efd_2_1035x444.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/2/42b69ec88c87bb9056712d83372297aa4ec07efd_2_1380x592.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAFAFA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">2662×1145 167 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><br>\nAfter adding the “Current Tasks” doctype, I saved it &amp; returned to the Home screen where I selected Save again.  The new entry should be next to Leaderboard<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/b/2/b2f8078545c7bd8824be625bf00d704fd0cf63aa.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/b2f8078545c7bd8824be625bf00d704fd0cf63aa\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/2/b2f8078545c7bd8824be625bf00d704fd0cf63aa_2_690x313.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"pxeoc2KxTMa8zPr3priqy1XpLjc\" width=\"690\" height=\"313\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/2/b2f8078545c7bd8824be625bf00d704fd0cf63aa_2_690x313.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/2/b2f8078545c7bd8824be625bf00d704fd0cf63aa_2_1035x469.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/2/b2f8078545c7bd8824be625bf00d704fd0cf63aa_2_1380x626.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FCFCFC\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">2912×1325 160 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><br>\nChanges were not applied so, not sure what is wrong</p>",
