    {
      "id": 395009,
      "username": "nudna",
      "name": "Ciaran",
      "created_at": "2024-02-22T23:03:56.890Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Ok I’ve worked out how to add a shortcut. In edit mode instead of going into settings instead go directly to the Your Shortcuts section and hover over any of the shortcuts and you will see a + appear. That will allow you to add any number of elements, one which is a new shortcut.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/b/1/b1c3e0cfd927ab11670983776c8bfcd7b1603f16.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/b1c3e0cfd927ab11670983776c8bfcd7b1603f16\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/1/b1c3e0cfd927ab11670983776c8bfcd7b1603f16_2_690x407.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"pmAb7i8kKRobxTiparbfG6vDL1A\" width=\"690\" height=\"407\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/1/b1c3e0cfd927ab11670983776c8bfcd7b1603f16_2_690x407.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/1/b1c3e0cfd927ab11670983776c8bfcd7b1603f16_2_1035x610.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/b/1/b1c3e0cfd927ab11670983776c8bfcd7b1603f16.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F8F8F8\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1071×632 61 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Here you can see I’ve added a Sales Order Shortcut.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/3/83ebf795175ace14d3c8de9c70a0b45389bb0186.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/83ebf795175ace14d3c8de9c70a0b45389bb0186\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/3/83ebf795175ace14d3c8de9c70a0b45389bb0186_2_690x407.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"iP26ySMY6GLarjvqBylvCPCQDr0\" width=\"690\" height=\"407\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/3/83ebf795175ace14d3c8de9c70a0b45389bb0186_2_690x407.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/3/83ebf795175ace14d3c8de9c70a0b45389bb0186_2_1035x610.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/3/83ebf795175ace14d3c8de9c70a0b45389bb0186.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9F9F9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1071×632 45.1 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Here I clicked the plus sign on the Sales Invoice and that means the element will inserted after the Sales Invoice. I’ve selected Shortcut from that dropdown list that appears as shown.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/e/5eb5e627097eb8679adbaffed6669fa925f07b3b.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/5eb5e627097eb8679adbaffed6669fa925f07b3b\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/e/5eb5e627097eb8679adbaffed6669fa925f07b3b_2_473x500.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"dvQB8X77bi6qMlDqgjO58swywMH\" width=\"473\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/e/5eb5e627097eb8679adbaffed6669fa925f07b3b_2_473x500.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/e/5eb5e627097eb8679adbaffed6669fa925f07b3b.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/e/5eb5e627097eb8679adbaffed6669fa925f07b3b.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9F9F9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">583×615 28.8 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>That open the dialog to add what you want. Here I’ve added a DocType for Tasks and named it Current Tasks and it will be linked to the List View of those Tasks. Then click Add.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/b/0/b061c3afdee5cfc21f093b8cdc4dd19b2fb2df5f.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/b061c3afdee5cfc21f093b8cdc4dd19b2fb2df5f\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/0/b061c3afdee5cfc21f093b8cdc4dd19b2fb2df5f_2_690x124.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"paluDbwohjgbnOFeQB7Cx2Q1EqX\" width=\"690\" height=\"124\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/0/b061c3afdee5cfc21f093b8cdc4dd19b2fb2df5f_2_690x124.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/b/0/b061c3afdee5cfc21f093b8cdc4dd19b2fb2df5f.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/b/0/b061c3afdee5cfc21f093b8cdc4dd19b2fb2df5f.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F7F7F7\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1034×187 12.3 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>It’s now added.</p>",
